From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:04:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dl-folds checkpoint 1: group G (the Games layer)

Promote the generic Games-layer lemmas of the nm-cca2 and nm-sim fills (DL-36, DL-37 group G),
delete the copies and re-point every use:
- G1 buildComp_of_ret, buildComp_budget_eq, NUPPT.toCompOn_budget_eq -> Games/Machines.lean
- G2 InteractiveHandler.impl_of_query, finish_of_ret -> Games/Efficiency.lean; list forms
  impl_of_ret_padFin, impl_of_query_padFin, finish_of_ret_padFin -> Games/Forwarding.lean;
  the private PRF impl_of_query folded
- G3 expect_toCompOn_outLen -> Games/Efficiency.lean
- G4 ProbComp.expect_congr_of_allOutputs (Hopping), ProbComp.expect_expect_sample (Probability),
  OracleComp.bind_congr_of_allOutputs, OracleComp.CostBoundedBy.bind_of_allOutputs (OracleComp),
  simulate_costBoundedBy_once (Simulate)
- G5 expect_simulate_eager -> Games/Hopping.lean; ChallengeSim.expect_simulate_eager derived
- G6 expect_eq_until_bad -> Games/Hopping.lean; prob_eq_until_bad derived from it
- G7 fwdHandler, fwdHandler_impl, NUPPT.exists_withAdviceOn -> new Games/Forwarding.lean;
  cntRead, ansRead -> Games/BitCodec.lean; InteractiveHandler.rAns published (R3)
